 .../VideoRenderers/RenderManager.cpp          | 11 ++-
 .../VideoRenderers/RenderManager.h            |  7 ++
 .../VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/StartSkips.h   | 93 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/StartSkips.h

